    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0788" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg668"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Tower to Acting Secretary of State
                        Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-10"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The German minister for foreign affairs announced to me that the agreement
                    between Germany and France in regard to Morocco was signed in Paris last
                    Saturday. He asked me to communicate the <pb facs="0789" n="669" xml:id="pg669"
                    /> information to you and say that the Government of Germany recognizes the
                    interest which the President has taken in that subject and greatly appreciates
                    what he has done to bring about speedy and peaceful solution of the questions at
                    issue.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tower.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
